<title>UK: Australian Wheat Board sets 20 bln yen June99 bond.</title>
<headline>Australian Wheat Board sets 20 bln yen June99 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Wako International, Commonwealth Bank of Australia and IBJ International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AUSTRALIAN WHEAT BOARD</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN YEN    COUPON    *5.30 PCT  MATURITY    24.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    24.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.60	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*REDEMPTION IN AUSTRALIAN DOLLARS</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 100-(M)1  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
